  **No Splink code is vendored.** This package reimplements Splink's entity
  resolution as pure SQL and uses Splink only as a test-time parity oracle.
  Both design documents cite Splink source files by path and line.

  The wider §24 question — whether verbatim comparison-level SQL strings
  constitute derived work, and what the package's stated position on them is —
  is **not settled here**. It is owned by PE-2 and must be answered before §19
  publishes anything, which is the first time anyone outside this repository
  installs the package.
